          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This heavy metallic "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+1 bola",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is a favorite tool of rebels and rabble-rousers against armored opponents. Due to its weight, it has a range increment of 15 feet. When you successfully Strike a creature made of metal or wearing metal armor with this weapon, the bola attaches to the metal and the targeted creature takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speed until it spends an Interact action to remove the bola."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "39ae079e-68b3-5b34-84eb-6e05278482ab"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Overcharge",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (electricity, manipulate, metal)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You overcharge the magnetic properties of the bola. You deal an extra 1d6 electricity damage with your next Strike with this weapon. On a hit, the target must also succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:reflex",
            "dc": 18
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save or become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "69f88e3c-d871-5fb9-82c6-120348a7c0e8",
            "label": "Clumsy 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " round (or "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "69f88e3c-d871-5fb9-82c6-120348a7c0e8",
            "label": "Clumsy 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on a critical failure), in addition to the normal effects. If the target is wearing metal armor, they take a –2 circumstance penalty to their save."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "8a7692fb-f14c-56ac-b97e-216c33cf434e"
          }
        ]
      },
